<p>A suspected hantavirus outbreak aboard a cruise ship in the Atlantic Ocean killed three people and sickened at least three others, the World Health Organization and South Africa’s Department of Health said Sunday. WHO said an investigation was underway and at least one hantavirus infection had been confirmed by laboratory testing. Reports identified the vessel as the MV Hondius, operated by Oceanwide Expeditions, and said the ship was off Cape Verde.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/VdhSAKidkYBrJ14TV2wE35tNMGVEeTCOJlixEbh2olNY6UfaJi0SeptiNswM19o2EnKgc2jCfDrqEdIPkkSFQkZn8o3IbsO_xlKgr4f9ALAV3D0DK94Cdyq4SEw35puGXxQOjZVAeAl1eJ3tyWnPHw0creFzE1OihFc-c_JHncRA3vC9O6749UUyh9lMxiukPw0mtJoD6_p_8cTlz6vZMZxfBqrK_z-zZi-Qf6xHLYAnSkU3CFi5yGhDGrIcrJSye7fGufj-ZM7D4Aqjbg' alt='The cruise ship MV Hondius stationary off the port of Praia, the capital of Cape Verde, on May 3, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Medical evacuations: WHO said it was working with authorities to medically evacuate two symptomatic people from the ship; one patient remained in intensive care in South Africa.</li><li>Transmission route: Health agencies say hantaviruses are rodent-borne viruses usually linked to exposure to infected rodents’ urine, droppings or saliva, with person-to-person spread described as rare.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>World Health Organization: WHO described the situation as a public health event involving a cruise ship and said it was supporting a coordinated international response. (<a href='https://www.kbc.co.ke/who-alert-as-hantavirus-outbreak-on-cruise-ship-leaves-three-dead/'>KBC</a>)</li><li>South Africa’s Department of Health: Department spokesperson Foster Mohale said a patient being treated in Johannesburg tested positive for hantavirus, making South African testing part of the case confirmation. (<a href='https://www.newstalkzb.co.nz/news/world/hantavirus-outbreak-suspected-in-three-deaths-from-cruise-ship/'>Newstalk ZB</a>)</li><li>Oceanwide Expeditions: The Dutch operator said Cape Verde authorities were assisting but had not allowed disembarkation. It identified the two sick people still aboard who needed urgent care as crew members. (<a href='https://www.nbcnewyork.com/news/national-international/suspected-outbreak-hantavirus-cruise-ship-atlantic-ocean/6497713/'>NBC New York</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/africa/article/3352294/3-dead-atlantic-cruise-ship-suspected-hantavirus-outbreak-who'>Suspected hantavirus outbreak on Atlantic cruise ship leaves 3 dead</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-suspected-hantavirus-atlantic-cruise-ship/'>Suspected hantavirus outbreak kills 3 on cruise ship in Atlantic Ocean, WHO says</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.boston.com/news/health/2026/05/03/a-suspected-hantavirus-outbreak-on-a-cruise-ship-in-the-atlantic-ocean-kills-3-people-who-says/'>A suspected hantavirus outbreak on a cruise ship in the Atlantic Ocean kills 3 people, WHO says</a> - boston.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/sci-tech/health/hantavirus-outbreak-in-mv-hondius-cruise-ship-deaths/article70936283.ece'>Suspected outbreak of rare hantavirus on cruise ship in Atlantic kills 3 people</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/three-dead-in-suspected-hantavirus-outbreak-aboard-cruise-ship-in-the-atlantic-ocean-who-says'>Three dead in suspected hantavirus outbreak aboard cruise ship in the Atlantic Ocean, WHO says</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/3-die-on-atlantic-cruise-ship-from-suspected-hantavirus-who-11444086#publisher=newsstand'>3 Die On Atlantic Cruise Ship From Suspected Hantavirus: WHO</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://en.mercopress.com/2026/05/04/three-dead-in-hantavirus-outbreak-aboard-polar-cruise-ship-from-ushuaia-bound-for-cape-verde'>Three dead in hantavirus outbreak aboard polar cruise ship from Ushuaia bound